# Optional (legacy, build time): Worker origin for live API (Cloudflare Access session cookie sent with credentials).
# Leave unset to use built-in stubs on the Vite dev server. A PRODUCTION build with nothing configured
# fails closed (visible configuration error) — prefer the runtime meta instead of rebuilding per environment:
#   <meta name="attestrack-portal-api" content="same-origin"> in the deployed index.html
# See docs/RUNTIME-CONFIG.md. Must be an https origin (http only on loopback), no path/query/hash/userinfo.
# Portal calls use /__attestrack__/portal/v1/* on this origin (see worker-core handlePortalRequest).
# VITE_ATTESTRACK_API_BASE_URL=https://your-worker.example.com
